---
/** Lays FlipCards side by side in a post (breaking out of the reading width, so three fit); stacks them on phones. */
---

<div class="flip-row not-prose max-w-none"><slot /></div>

<style>
  .flip-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(16rem, 21rem));
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: start;
  }
</style>
